<title>FRANCE: LVMH raises Grand Met stake - mkt source.</title>
<headline>LVMH raises Grand Met stake - mkt source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>LVMH Moet Hennessy Louis Vuitton has raised its stake in Grand Metropolitan to more than 10 percent, a market source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>LVMH has confirmed that it bought GrandMet shares today but did not say how many. It said it also sold Guinness shares.</p>
<p>LVMH previously held 14.2 percent of Guinness and 6.4 percent of GrandMet. It is the biggest shareholder in both companies and wants to prevent a merger between them announced in May.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
